+// P4 step 5: region modules in the dispatcher (docs/region-translator.md).
+// A region is installed on the CPU thread from bytes queued by any thread
+// (the module is compiled here, a cache hit once the compiler worker has
+// built it); its entries map a PC to its handle. ExecuteOneBlock runs the
+// region holding the PC before looking for a block. Regions were translated
+// for translation and FP on (a DOL's code): they run only in that mode.
+namespace
